{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1560,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today I am doing an experiment that demonstrates\nHeisenberg’s Uncertainty Principle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5520,
    "dDurationMs": 5810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sao her I have a green laser and I am firing\nit down towards the front of the room through"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11330,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a narrow slit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12780,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now that slit can be adjusted so it can be\nmade narrower or wider."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16920,
    "dDurationMs": 3310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the laser spot is projected on to a screen\nbehind it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20230,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what do you think is going to happen to\nthis spot on the screen as I narrow the slit?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24510,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, let’s have a look."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26730,
    "dDurationMs": 2889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see exactly what you would expect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29619,
    "dDurationMs": 2011,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The spot gets narrower and narrower."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31630,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The sides are getting cut off by the slit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33490,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It makes complete sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35660,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you stop there you would never realize\nthat Heisenberg’s Uncertainty Principle"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40340,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is at work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41550,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you keep going something strange happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45540,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As you make the slit ever narrower the spot\nstarts to spread out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51420,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Isn’t that incredible?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54020,
    "dDurationMs": 6350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You are making the slit narrower, and yet\nthe spot on the wall is getting wider."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60370,
    "dDurationMs": 4730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The narrower you make it, the wider that spot\non the wall becomes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65100,
    "dDurationMs": 3949,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To understand this we have to look at Heisenberg’s\nUncertainty Principle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69049,
    "dDurationMs": 5641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Heisenberg’s Uncertainty Principle is normally\nwritten as delta x, delta p is greater than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74690,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or equal to h on four pi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77570,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what does this mean?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78570,
    "dDurationMs": 4030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, it is about the position and the momentum\nof a particle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82600,
    "dDurationMs": 3689,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So x is the position of the particle and p\nis its momentum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86289,
    "dDurationMs": 6290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So delta x is the uncertainty in position\nand delta p is the uncertainty in the momentum."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92579,
    "dDurationMs": 4321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now if you multiply those two quantities together\nthey must always be greater than or equal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96900,
    "dDurationMs": 2009,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to h on four pi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98909,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now h is Planck’s Constant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100679,
    "dDurationMs": 3591,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that deserves a video all to itself, like\nthis one by 60 Symbols."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104270,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But for our purposes it is just a very small\nnumber."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107189,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in our every day lives we don’t come\nup against this uncertainty relation, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111659,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everything is much, much bigger than h."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114069,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as we narrowed the slit we were decreasing\ndelta x for those photons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120109,
    "dDurationMs": 4631,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we were getting more and more precise about\nwhere the photons were passing through that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124740,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "slit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125860,
    "dDurationMs": 5790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in a certain point you come to this limit\nso that if you narrow this any further, you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131650,
    "dDurationMs": 3050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are going to break this uncertainty relationship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134700,
    "dDurationMs": 4690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what needs to happen is the uncertainty\nof momentum needs to go up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139390,
    "dDurationMs": 5069,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I should specify this is uncertainty in momentum\nin the x direction, in the horizontal direction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144459,
    "dDurationMs": 5390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if before photons were going perfectly\nstraight, now they must veer off to the left"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149849,
    "dDurationMs": 5241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or the to the right to ensure that we don’t\nbreak Heisenberg’s uncertainty relation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155090,
    "dDurationMs": 4729,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the more you decrease your uncertainty\nin position, the more narrow you make that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159819,
    "dDurationMs": 4411,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "slit, the more the uncertainty in momentum\nhas to go up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164230,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so if these photons are going to the left\nand the right, .that is going to produce a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167760,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "might wider beam."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169010,
    "dDurationMs": 5110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is really, really non intuitive, but it\nis the way the world works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174120,
    "dDurationMs": 5789,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e It must be the sun playing tricks with\nmy mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179909,
    "dDurationMs": 8300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e What about.... this is really going to\ntest you, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188209,
    "dDurationMs": 1791,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "[ multiple voices ]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190000,
    "dDurationMs": 4070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have got to say a big thank you to Professor\nWalter Lewin at MIT."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194070,
    "dDurationMs": 1479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He inspired me to make this video."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195549,
    "dDurationMs": 4030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I also have to say a big thanks to the\nUniversity of Sydney for letting me use their"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199579,
    "dDurationMs": 4821,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "equipment and especially to Tom and Ralph\nfor helping me set this all up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204400,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, and just one more thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206520,
    "dDurationMs": 3850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I should point out that this explanation of\nthe experiment is slightly controversial,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210370,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at least in that Henry from Minute Physics\nand I have been debating whether it is really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214250,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that counter intuitive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215340,
    "dDurationMs": 5399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, if you see light as a wave, then all\nlight is doing here is defracting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220739,
    "dDurationMs": 4691,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the phenomenon where if a wave passes\nthrough the slit it bends at the corners and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225430,
    "dDurationMs": 1430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "radiates out in all directions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226860,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that explains the spreading of the beam."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229340,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that goes to the very nature of light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230980,
    "dDurationMs": 2089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it made of waves or particles?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233069,
    "dDurationMs": 2331,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is something that I would like to explore\nin the coming weeks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235400,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So stay tuned for that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236810,
    "dDurationMs": 3759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Henry has an excellent video about Heisenberg’s\nUncertainty Principle, which I think makes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240569,
    "dDurationMs": 1831,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it more intuitive and less spooky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242400,
    "dDurationMs": 1970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you want to check that out, click on\nthe annotation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244370,
    "dDurationMs": 7110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a really good video."
    } ]
  } ]
}
